<#macro taskStrip>
          <div class="task-strip" aria-label="Common tasks">
            <article>
              <strong>Check</strong>
              <p><code>frmtrCheck</code> verifies project-local Java sources and is wired into <code>check</code>.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <strong>Format</strong>
              <p><code>frmtrFormat</code> rewrites selected Java sources in place.</p>
            </article>
            <article>
              <strong>Tune</strong>
              <p>Set includes, excludes, parser level, line width, and diff printing only when the defaults need help.</p>
            </article>
          </div>
</#macro>
